This folder contains some of the projects used in the RSU Coding and Smart Systems Outreach Program.

The following is the link to a comprehensive list of open source projects:
https://freenove.com/tutorial
Complete Starter Kit: https://docs.freenove.com/projects/fnk0066/en/latest/


Raspberry Pi hardware components vary across kits.

Depending on the kit that you would like to purchase for your program, You can download projects and tutorial for that specific kit.
